From: momokind <momokind2002@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] VideoPlayer: DVDDemuxers: merge dual-track Dolby Vision (Blu-ray ISO/M2TS, MKV, MP4)

Port CDVLayerMerge from LibreELEC-Hades (including the Blu-ray transport
stream PID 0x1011/0x1015 pairing without PMT HDMV registration descriptor)
to join dual-track Dolby Vision Profile 7 streams into single-track packets
with HAVE_PIDV / ENABLE_PIDV.

